---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Writing
description: Blog posts and short articles on economics, policy and causal inference.
---
<div class="wrap narrow">
  <header class="page-head">
    <div class="eyebrow">Writing</div>
    <h1>Writing</h1>
    <p class="lede">Short articles on Pakistan's economy, public policy and the practice of causal inference. Longer opinion pieces in newspapers are collected on the <a href="/media/">media page</a>.</p>
  </header>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:16px">
    <ul class="list">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
      <li class="item post-row">
        <span class="date">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span>
        <div>
          <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
          {% if post.data.summary %}<p class="abstract">{{ post.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
        </div>
      </li>
      {% else %}
      <li class="empty">First posts coming soon.</li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p style="margin-top:32px;font-size:.92rem;color:var(--faint)">Follow along with the <a href="/feed.xml">RSS feed</a>.</p>
  </section>
</div>
